<title>JAPAN: Tokyo rubber market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo rubber market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo rubber market is closed for a national holiday on Monday. Trading will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, Tokyo rubber futures ended lower in lacklustre trade. Benchmark April was 1.4 yen lower at 141.5 yen.</p>
</text>
